  "name": "scm_call120_negative_cloud_ice_fallout_inputs",
  "description": "Input column fields of inline test `scm_call120_negative_cloud_ice_fallout` of WSM6HydrometeorSlopes, not a WRF dump as it stands: the column of scm_call120_ice_only_lowest_40_layers (WRF kernel dump scm_ref_120.json, tile column 0, of a WRF v4.8.0 em_scm_xy run of the instrumented WRF fork ctessum-claude/WRF, commit e42a269 (v4.8.0-2-ge42a269e)) with the cloud-ice mixing ratio set to -1e-12 kg/kg in layers 5, 10 and 20, the round-off negative values WRF's advection leaves behind. Each match rule lowers one `input_<name>` rewrite target of the component to the profile; the test injects this library through its expression_template_imports (esm-spec 9.7.10).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "test-inputs"
  ]
 },
